"Shark—a symbol of lethal menace. It is a predator perfectly fit for sea hunting. The shark is known for its strength, quickness, firmness, and lust for blood.\n"
"The Sharks Team will welcome courageous, self-confident, and steadfast players who know how to achieve their goals.\n"
