msgstr "Generates a smoke screen that reduces the risk of being detected by the enemy."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY316_CRASHCREW_PVP"
msgstr "<p>Extinguishes fires, removes instances of flooding, and repairs damaged modules.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Damage-control consumable.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY317_SONARSEARCH_PVP"
msgstr "Increases the range of assured acquisition of enemy ships and torpedoes, including those within smoke screens."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY318_RLSSEARCH_PVP"
msgstr "Significantly increases the range of assured acquisition of ships and submarines on the surface, including those within smoke screens."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY319_SPEEDBOOSTER_PVP"
msgstr "Protects from the Filth and increases the ship's maximum speed. Your ship will not receive damage exceeding her HP."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY320_TORPEDORELOADER_PVP"
msgstr "Reduces torpedo tube reload time."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY321_INVULNERABLE_PVP"
msgstr "Protects the ship from all damage types."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY322_RESIST_H2019"
msgstr "Reduces the damage you take by 90%."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY323_IMPROVE_H2019"
msgstr ""
"Your ship and all allies within a 5 km radius receive the Armament Reload Speed buff. Your ship gets an additional buff for each ally within the 5 km radius.\n"
"Any buffs are active until the end of the battle."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY324_RESSURECTION_H2019"
msgstr "Restores your ship after it's been destroyed."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY325_IMPROVEREGEN_H2019"
msgstr ""
"Your ship and all allies within a 5 km radius receive the Continuous Ship HP Regeneration buff. Your ship gets an additional buff for each ally within the 5 km radius.\n"
"Any buffs are active until the end of the battle."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY326_INVULNERABLEZONE_H2019"
msgstr "All allies within a 5 km radius become invincible."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY327_IMPROVESPEED_H2019"
msgstr "Your ship and all allies within 5 km receive the 'Ship Maneuverability' upgrade. For each ally within 5 km, your ship receives an additional upgrade. Upgrades last until the end of battle."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY328_TURNAROUND_H2019"
msgstr "Ship immediately makes a U-turn and torpedo tube reload time is reduced."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY329_IMMORTAL_H2019"
msgstr "Reduces detectability range by half and restores 300 HP per second for as long as the ship remains undetected by the enemy."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY330_SPEEDBOOSTER_H2019"
msgstr "Increases the ship's maximum speed. The ship won't take an amount of damage greater than her HP. Applies to all types of damage except for ramming."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY331_ARTILLERYBOOSTER_H2019"
msgstr "Reduces main battery gun reload time."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY332_REGENCREW_H2019"
msgstr "<p>Partially restores the ship's HP by repairing any light damage.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Repair consumable.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY333_HEALALL_H2019"
msgstr "Restores 10,000 HP to all allied ships."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY334_HEALSHELL_H2019"
msgstr ""
"A hit to your ally will restore 3,000 HP to that ally and 3,000 HP to your ship. \n"
"Main gun reload time is reduced by half."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY335_REGENRESIST_H2019"
msgstr "Restores 1,000 HP per second. Reduces damage received by 80%."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY336_VAMPIRIC_H2019"
msgstr "Accelerates the reload time of the main battery guns. Restores the ship's HP by 50% of the damage caused."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY337_LIFEDRAIN_H2019"
msgstr "Restores your ship's HP at a rate of 500 HP per second. Each enemy ship within a 5 km radius of the ship provides an additional 500 HP restoration per second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY338_HEALZONE_H2019"
msgstr "Creates a repair zone with a 5 km radius around the ship. Both your and allied ships within this zone recover HP at a rate of 500 HP per second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY401_CRASHCREW_H2020"
msgstr "Extinguishes fires, removes instances of flooding, and repairs damaged modules."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY402_REGEN_H2020"
msgstr "Regenerates 1,000 ship HP per second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY403_SPEEDBOOSTER_H2020"
msgstr "Increases the ship's maximum speed, reduces acceleration and deceleration time."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY404_HEALZONE_H2020"
msgstr "Creates a zone within a 5 km radius of the ship in which your ship and allied ships can regenerate 1,000 HP per second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY405_INVULNERABLEZONE_H2020"
msgstr "Creates a zone within a 5 km radius of the ship in which your ship and allied ships become invulnerable."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY406_HEALALL_H2020"
msgstr "Regenerates 10,000 HP for your ship and all allied ships."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY407_RESISTALLBUFF_H2020"
msgstr "Reduces damage taken by your ship and all allied ships by 75%."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY408_HEALBUFF_H2020"
msgstr "Gives allies within a 5 km radius a temporary buff: HP Regeneration."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY409_SPEEDBUFF_H2020"
msgstr "Gives allies within a 5 km radius a temporary buff: Maximum Ship Speed Increase."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY410_DRAINZONE_H2020"
msgstr "<p>Regenerates 500 HP per second for your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Your HP regeneration rate increases by 500 HP per second for each enemy ship located within a 5 km radius.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY411_CIRCLEWAVE_H2020"
msgstr ""
"Emits a circular wave up to a 5 km radius.\n"
"The damage dealt is proportional to the size of the damage area.\n"
"The waves can destroy passing enemy torpedoes and neutralize same-type waves."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY412_INVISIBLEREGEN_H2020"
msgstr "Reduces the detectability of your ship and also regenerates 500 HP per second until your ship is detected again."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY413_TURNAROUND_H2020"
msgstr "Enables you to instantly make a 180° turn in order to quickly escape from danger."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY414_BUFFSSHIFT_SHOTDELAY"
msgstr "Reduces main armament reload time."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY415_BUFFSSHIFT_ENGINEBOOST"
msgstr "Increases the ship's maximum speed, reduces acceleration and deceleration time."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY416_BUFFSSHIFT_REGENERATION"
msgstr "Continuously regenerates the ship's HP."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY417_BUFFSSHIFT_GSSHOTDELAY"
msgstr "Increases the secondary battery firing rate."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY418_BUFFSSHIFT_DAMAGERESIST"
msgstr "Absorbs damage dealt to the ship."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY500_GODEEP"
msgstr ""
"The ship submerges for a short period of time.\n"
"When submerged, enemy shells, torpedoes, and waves won't deal any damage to your ship.\n"
"While underwater, maneuverability is preserved and the ship's speed is increased."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY501_BUFFSSHIFT_VAMPYRE"
msgstr "Regenerates HP when damage is dealt to enemy ships."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY502_GSSHOTDELAY"
msgstr "Increases auxiliary armament range and reload speed."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY503_GMSHOTDELAY"
msgstr "Reduces the reload time of the main armament."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY506_SPEEDBOOSTER_FA2022"
msgstr "Increases rubber duckie's maximum speed and determination."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY507_REGENCREW_FA2022"
msgstr "Partially restores rubber duckie's HP and lifts her spirits."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY508_CRASHCREW_FA2022"
msgstr "<p>Eliminates instances of flooding and prevents the spread of bacteria.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Not a medication, but it has negative side effects. Consult an expert before using.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY509_SPEEDBOOSTER_SMF2024"
msgstr "Increases ship's maximum speed and reduces acceleration and braking times."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY510_TURNAROUND_SMF2024"
msgstr "Instantly turns your ship 180° for a quick escape from danger."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY511_2025WT_ADDDD"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Akizuki destroyer-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton grants a permanent 5% bonus to your ship's armament rate of fire. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY512_2025WT_ADDCR"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Myōkō cruiser-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton grants a permanent 2% bonus to your ship's durability. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY513_2025WT_ADDBB"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Fusō battleship-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton permanently restores 30 hp per second to your ship. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY514_2025WT_STEALTHTELEPORT"
msgstr "Instantly moves your ship 3 km in the direction of view. Reduces your ship's detectability to 2 km. Reduces the increased detectability time after firing Main Battery guns to 1 second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY515_2025WT_STEALTHHEAL"
msgstr "Reduces ship detectability to 2 km and restores 2,500 hp per second. Ship detectability immediately after firing is reduced to the minimum."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY516_2025WT_PARTICLEBARRIER"
msgstr "Creates a shield around your ship that blocks and accumulates all damage received. After the duration ends, the shield explodes, dealing all accumulated damage to every enemy within the consumable's area of effect."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY517_2025WT_HOUNDSVAMPIRISM"
msgstr "Converts 25% of damage dealt into hp for your ship and 10% for each allied ship. Increases the rate of fire of all your ship's armament by 30%."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY518_2025WT_HOUNDSRESIST"
msgstr "Reduces damage received by 70% for all ships on your team."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY519_2025WT_HOUNDSBATTLEFORSAGE"
msgstr "Significantly speeds up the ship for a short period."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY520_2025WT_HOUNDSMASSHEAL"
msgstr "Instantly restores 7,500 hp to each ship on your team."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY521_2025WT_HOUNDSSPEEDBOOSTER"
msgstr "Increases the speed and maneuverability of all ships on your team by 40%."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY522_2025WT_HOUNDSROTARYAC"
msgstr "Reduces reload time by 10% and enhances other Main Battery gun characteristics on your ship for every 10 hits on a single enemy ship. Progress resets upon hitting another target."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY525_2025WT_HOUNDSINVULNERABLE"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability to all damage types."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY527_2025WT_WT3_TELEPORT"
msgstr "Teleports the ship to a random Hound. All summoned automatons will be teleported with you."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY528_2025WT_FIREANDICE"
msgstr "<p>Creates an area around your ship in which all enemies are inflicted with Fire and Flooding, and are unable to use the Damage Control Party consumable.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Half the damage dealt by fires and floods is converted into your ship's hp.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY529_2025WT_DONORPARTS"
msgstr "All automatons you called receive 5,000 damage. All damage received by automatons is converted into your ship's hp."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY530_2025WT_METAL_CORROSION"
msgstr "Creates an area around your ship where all enemies receive damage equal to that dealt to your ship. Damage is split equally among enemies. Additionally, every ship within the area receives damage per second equal to 5% of its base HP."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY532_2025WT_QUANTUMLEAP"
msgstr "<p>7 seconds after activation, teleports your ship to a random Hound ship within 10 km.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Consumable is inactive if there are no Hound ships within 10 km.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY533_2025WT_HOUNDSMEGAHEAL"
msgstr "Restores 1,000 hp per second."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY534_2025WT_HOUNDSSLOWDOWN"
msgstr "Hitting an enemy ship with Main Battery shells reduces its speed and maneuverability by 50%. Effect lasts 20 seconds."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY535_2025WT_HOUNDSSUPERDESPERATE"
msgstr "Grants a permanent 25% bonus to damage dealt and 25% to the reload speed of all armament. However, while the consumable is active, your ship continuously takes damage. Bonus is lost if your ship is destroyed."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY536_2025WT_HOUNDSLOSSCOUNTER"
msgstr "Grants a permanent 5% bonus to rate of fire, durability, and ship maneuverability, and restores hp. The number of consumables increases with each lost ally. Bonuses and accumulated consumable charges are lost if your ship is destroyed."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY537_2025WT_HOUNDSLASTCHANSE"
msgstr "Grants invulnerability to all damage if the ship's durability reaches 1% while the consumable is active."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY538_2025WT_HOUNDSTORPEDOCOUNTERATTACK"
msgstr "Instantly reloads the torpedo tube if your ship is hit by a Main Battery shell."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY539_2025WT_HOUNDSALTMASSHEAL"
msgstr "Restores 400 hp per second to each ship on your team."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY540_2025WT_ADDDD2"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Cossack destroyer-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton grants a permanent 10% bonus to the rate of fire of all living automatons' armament. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY541_2025WT_ADDCR2"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Surrey cruiser-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton grants a permanent 10% bonus to the durability of all living automatons. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY542_2025WT_ADDBB2"
msgstr "<p>Calls the King George V battleship-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>When entering battle, the automaton permanently restores 40 hp per second to all living automatons. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY543_2025WT_ADDDD3"
msgstr "<p>Calls the G. J. Maerker destroyer-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>While the automaton is alive, it grants a permanent 15% bonus to the rate of fire of your ship's and all automatons' armament. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY544_2025WT_ADDCR3"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Yorck cruiser-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>While the automaton is alive, it permanently restores 50 hp per second to your ship and all living automatons. Bonuses from identical automatons stack.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY545_2025WT_ADDBB3"
msgstr "<p>Calls the Derfflinger battleship-automaton.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Each use consumes one charge of all 'Signal' type consumables. Consumable charges are replenished using 'Signal Generator' battle instructions.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Aim at an enemy ship and press [KEY_F3] to focus automaton fire on that ship.</p>"

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY546_2025WT_HOUNDSINVADER"
msgstr "Teleports your ship to one of the Key Areas captured by Ermelinda Jung."

msgid "IDS_DOCK_CONSUME_DESCRIPTION_PXY547_2025WT_WT3_TELEPORT2"
msgstr "Teleports your ship to a Key Area that is captured by the Hounds and has no Hounds present. You cannot teleport to the Key Area you are currently on."

