msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB119_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Every year on May 9, Russia celebrates Victory Day, a holiday dedicated to the victory of the Soviet people over Nazi Germany."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB119_NAME"
msgstr "May 9"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB120_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "On November 1, 1943, the U.S. Marines, under the cover of warships, landed in Empress Augusta Bay on the island of Bougainville to establish a beachhead. In response, Japan sent aircraft and a cruiser squadron. The battle lasted until November 2 and ended in a decisive victory for the American forces."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB120_NAME"
msgstr "Sakura Flower"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB121_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "On July 4, 1776, the U.S. Declaration of Independence was adopted, declaring the independence of the British colonies in North America from Great Britain. This day is now a national holiday in the United States, observed every year with public events that honor the nation's heritage, history, laws, and society."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB121_NAME"
msgstr "July 4"

