msgstr "Imperial Aquila"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB233_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "<p>The Iron Halo has its origins in the earliest days of the Imperium. It is an award for exceptional battlefield leaders and strategists who demonstrate exceptional initiative in battle.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>From the Warhammer 40,000 universe.</p>"

