msgstr "Iron Halo"

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB234_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "<p>A sign of favor from one of the Ruinous Powers, often bestowed upon a loyal subject. It is a brand connecting the person to his deity and an outward sign of his devotion.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>From the Warhammer 40,000 universe.</p>"

