msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB253_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "'The Friday the 13th Battle', which took place in November 1942, was fatal for the light cruiser Atlanta. However, two years after the sinking of USS Atlanta, it 'rose from the ashes', repeating the fate of the city it was named after: in December 1944, a new cruiser bearing this glorious name was commissioned."

msgid "IDS_DOGTAG_PCNB253_NAME"
