msgid "IDS_META_EVENT_DESCRIPTION_ACTIVE"
msgstr "<p>In the distant future, a breach between worlds was discovered on Earth's surface, threatening all of civilization. Special squads composed of the planet's finest commanders were formed to investigate and eliminate the anomaly.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Take part in an intergalactic mission and discover what the silence of the Universe conceals.</p>"

msgid "IDS_META_EVENT_DESCRIPTION_FINISHED"
msgstr "<p>After hundreds of thousands of expeditions to the Limit, the commanders uncovered the truth: the Curator was not transporting them to other worlds, but to a possible future of Earth. The ships were not piloted by the people themselves, but only by their minds — this allowed the Curator to 'revive' the fighters again and again, to observe the course of battles, gathering valuable information on new types of weaponry and military tactics.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>And as long as the Limit remains open, the Curator will carry out its mission. But at what cost will it come to the Earth of the future?</p>"

