msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_SNOWFLAKES_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_HEADER"
msgstr "How to earn rewards"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_SNOWFLAKES_RULES_PARAGRAPH_1_TEXT_1"
msgstr "Every Soviet ship in your Port, from Tier III to super ships, has been granted a festive reward. To claim a ship's reward, you must take it into battle and earn 300 base XP or achieve a victory."

