msgstr "At the end of the event, any unclaimed rewards will be removed without compensation."

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_SNOWFLAKES_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_HEADER"
msgstr "More rewards per battle"

msgid "IDS_MODAL_WINDOW_SNOWFLAKES_RULES_PARAGRAPH_2_TEXT_1"
msgstr "If you earn more base XP in a battle on a ship with a reward, you can claim rewards from other ships without entering battle with them."

