msgstr ""
"Under the moonlit sky, the sea is churning, onshore catapults are creaking, and dreadful zombie ships are chasing the living.\n"
"Rasputin, your arch enemy, has its guns loaded and ready to fire.\n"
"Help Transylvania reach her destination and don't let her fall victim to the awakened evil."

msgid "IDS_PCVO024_EV_HL_16_50_VANHELLSING_GOAL"
