msgid "IDS_PCZC101_MK_CAPREWORK"
msgstr "Winds of Change"

msgid "IDS_PCZC101_MK_CAPREWORK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "<p>The highlight of version 0.6.0 was a major update to Commanders. Numerous changes, new skills, and the new feature – Elite Commander XP – immediately sparked stormy discussions even during the Public Test.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>It took guts, but thanks to support from players (and a little black magic), developers went on to click on the \"Release Version\" button even though we did have some concerns. And the risk paid off – the updated system of Commander skills has successfully served the needs of players ever since.</p>"

