msgstr "<p>A project for a fast battleship with four main battery turrets and a displacement of 50,000 tons. It differs from its predecessor by an increased length of 30 m and is the largest of the preliminary drafts developed by the designers of the Naval Construction Administration of the German Naval Staff in 1918.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>This is the project for the largest and most heavily armed of all German battleships until the studies for the H battleship conducted in the early 1940s.</p>"

