msgid "IDS_PJSB906_YEAR"
msgstr "1917"

msgid "IDS_PJSB910"
msgstr "HND Raijū"

msgid "IDS_PJSB910_DESCR"
msgstr "<p>The experimental battleship Raijū was built under conditions of utmost secrecy at the naval shipyard in Kure as part of the Alliance's program to create new-generation universal combat platforms.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>The ship's name refers to a mythical creature from Japanese folklore associated with lightning and storms. This image was reflected in the ship's concept: Raijū was conceived as a strike combat unit capable of delivering devastating blows with terrifying power, reacting swiftly to threats, and withstanding attacks even from submarines thanks to enhanced torpedo protection.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Classified. Not officially listed in the inventory of any fleet.</p>"

