msgstr "<p>Variant of a large high-speed cruiser project with 310-mm main battery artillery, torpedo armament consisting of four quadruple 610-mm launchers, and enhanced anti-aircraft armament.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>This project's ship was intended for combating enemy heavy cruisers.</p>"

