msgid "IDS_PJSC810"
msgstr "Zaō P"

msgid "IDS_PJSC810_DESCR"
msgstr "<p>According to Japan's fleet replenishment program, it was planned to build eight heavy cruisers, which represented a further development of the Takao, Tone, and Mogami types.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>The ships' armament was to consist of twelve 203-mm guns in four turrets arranged in the classic layout, and their armor was to provide protection against 203-mm high-explosive shells. Subsequently, the number of ships was reduced to four, and then their construction was canceled altogether.</p>"

