msgid "IDS_PXSB002"
msgstr "Rasputin"

msgid "IDS_PXSB002_DESCR"
msgstr "<p>Long-range combat warship.<br>Difficulty: high.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>A mysterious battleship, the enigmatic flagship of the Twilight Fleet. Little is known about her place of construction, and even less about who and why designed and built this ship. Those who have encountered her in combat recount that Rasputin is somehow capable of affecting the human mind by depriving the rivaling Commanders of the ability to give orders.</p>"

