msgstr "<p>Short-range combat warship.<br>Difficulty: low</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Ghoul is a ghost ship molded from the parts of various monsters and revitalized with the magic of Victor F. Einstein. The sea folk of Intania say that if you let the crippled Ghoul disappear from sight for only a minute, she will come back without fail, intact, and ready to bring doom upon every living creature.</p>"

