msgid "IDS_PZSA508"
msgstr "Sanzang"

msgid "IDS_PZSA508_DESCR"
msgstr "Sanzang is a Buddhist monk, scientist, philosopher, traveler, and translator. He is not only an eminent person, but also the main character from \"Journey to the West\", a novel by Wu Cheng'en."

