msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE"
msgstr "Role"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_ASSAULT"
msgstr "Breakthrough"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_ASSAULT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Close in on the enemy to secondary battery firing range. Lead the flank breakthrough with allied support.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_FIRE_SUPPORT"
msgstr "Fire Support"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_FIRE_SUPPORT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Provide cover for allies with main battery fire. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Second-line ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_JEAN_BART_43"
msgstr "Secondaries Sniper"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_JEAN_BART_43_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Take control of numerous small-caliber guns while the large-caliber gun fires automatically. Close in on enemies and carefully select priority targets for the large-caliber gun, which fires BB shells.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Unique role.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_PROVOKE"
msgstr "Provocateur"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_PROVOKE_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Draw enemy fire to cover allied ships. Lead the flank breakthrough with allied support.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_SNIPER"
msgstr "Sniper"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_BB_SNIPER_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Attack the enemy from long range, relying on allied intelligence. Maneuver to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Second-line ships. Most vulnerable when closing in on the enemy.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_ASSAULT"
msgstr "Assault"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_ASSAULT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Close in on the enemy to secondary battery firing range. Lead the flank breakthrough with allied support.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_FIRE_SUPPORT"
msgstr "Fire Support"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_FIRE_SUPPORT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Provide cover for allies with main battery fire. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Second-line ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_KITAKAMI"
msgstr "Super Torpedo Cruiser"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_KITAKAMI_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Use torpedoes as your primary armament. Maintain distance from enemy ships. Detect enemy cruisers and battleships. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Unique role.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_NORTHAMPRTON"
msgstr "Aircraft support ship"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_NORTHAMPRTON_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Support your allies with squadrons. Avoid direct confrontations with enemy ships. Fire at the enemy using islands as cover.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Unique role.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_SPOTTING"
msgstr "Spotting"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_SPOTTING_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Use detection tools to combat enemy destroyers and light cruisers. Support allied destroyers on Key Areas. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_TORPEDO"
msgstr "Torpedo Cruiser"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CA_TORPEDO_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Hinder enemy advancement with torpedoes and provide cover for allies with main battery fire. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Second-line ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_COLON"
msgstr "Role:"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CV_ATTACK"
msgstr "Attack Aircraft Carrier"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CV_ATTACK_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Deal damage using squadrons and conduct reconnaissance for allies.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Ships of this role are most effective against single targets.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CV_SUPPORT"
msgstr "Support Aircraft Carrier"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_CV_SUPPORT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Support allies using special equipment and squadrons.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Ships of this role have reduced strike potential.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_FIRE_SUPPORT"
msgstr "Fire Support"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_FIRE_SUPPORT_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Provide cover for allies with main battery fire. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Second-line ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_HUNTER"
msgstr "Hunter"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_HUNTER_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Hunt for destroyers and destroy them with main battery fire. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship. Capture Key Areas, pick up enhancements, and fight for other important areas on the battlefield. Conduct reconnaissance for allies.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_PAOLO_EMILIO"
msgstr "Dive Bomber Destroyer"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_PAOLO_EMILIO_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Carry out sudden devastating torpedo attacks from behind islands or using the 'Full Speed Smoke Generator' together with 'Engine Boost'. Maneuver or hide in smoke to make it harder for the enemy to fire upon your ship. Conduct reconnaissance for allies.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Unique role.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_TORPEDO"
msgstr "Torpedo Destroyer"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_TORPEDO_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Flank enemies to carry out the most effective torpedo attacks. Conduct reconnaissance for allies. Capture Key Areas, pick up enhancements, and fight for other important areas on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Frontline ships.</p>"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_UNIVERSAL"
msgstr "Universal"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DD_UNIVERSAL_DESC"
msgstr "The main battery and torpedoes on these ships are equally effective.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Flank enemies to carry out the most effective torpedo attacks. Provide cover for allies with main battery fire. Capture Key Areas, pick up enhancements, and fight for other important areas on the battlefield. Conduct reconnaissance for allies."

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_DETAILED_COLON"
msgstr "Your Role:"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_SS_SILENT_HUNTER"
msgstr "Silent Hunter"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_SS_SILENT_HUNTER_DESC"
msgstr "Carry out stealth attacks using torpedoes. Conduct reconnaissance for allies on the surface, as well as using hydroacoustics at periscope or operational depth. Capture Key Areas, pick up enhancements, and fight for other important areas on the battlefield."

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_SS_SURCOUF"
msgstr "Submarine Cruiser"

msgid "IDS_SHIP_ROLE_SS_SURCOUF_DESC"
msgstr "<p>Carry out stealth attacks using torpedoes. On the surface, use trainable torpedo tubes. Engage in short-range skirmishes with destroyers using both main battery and torpedoes. Provide cover for allies with main battery fire from a safe distance using the 'Spotting Aircraft'. Conduct reconnaissance for allies on the surface, as well as using hydroacoustics at periscope or operational depth.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>Unique role.</p>"

