msgid "IDS_WT_PROGRESS_EVENT_FINISHED_TEXT"
msgstr "<p>The forces were equal — both the Alliance and Ermelinda Jung were forced to retreat, failing to achieve their goals.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>The world does not yet know what happened, but a new game is already beginning behind the scenes. The Alliance has strength and influence, while Ermelinda has classified documents and technologies.</p><p class=\"p_spacing\"> </p><p>The Alliance will no longer be able to remain in the shadows. A period begins that will later be called the Resonance.</p>"

